        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1789010320
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>like I don't think type information would matter even if it had access to it <span aria-label=\"smile\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f604\" role=\"img\" title=\"smile\">:smile:</span></p>",
        "id": 623024173,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1789010339
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Can I expose a nested type with the same name as the parent?</p>",
